      "directNodeIds": [
        "cnm_159"
      ],
      "explanation": "The least common denominator is \\(x(x+1)\\). Multiplying both the numerator and denominator of \\(1/x\\) by \\(x+1\\) gives \\((x+1)/[x(x+1)]\\). Multiplying both the numerator and denominator of \\(1/(x+1)\\) by \\(x\\) gives \\(x/[x(x+1)]\\).",
